<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pride Petroleum Services.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pride Petroleum Services.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Jefferies and Co analyst Sam Albright said he upgraded Price Petroleum Services Ind to a buy from accumulate. No reason for the upgrade was given.</p>
<p>-- Shares were trading at 16-1/4, up 3/8 in midday exchange trading.</p>
